<p dir="ltr">A high-end renovation goes beyond a straightforward refurbishment, it usually involves structural changes, bespoke joinery, premium materials, and a fully coordinated <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/design-and-build/">design and build</a> process rather than separate trades working in isolation. Reviewing <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/how-much-does-a-design-and-build-project-cost-in-london-in-2026/">how much a design and build project costs in London</a> gives homeowners a realistic benchmark before entering pre-construction. Think custom kitchens, natural stone, integrated smart-home systems, and finishes specified down to the door handles.</p>

